  "name": "Carbon Dioxide Concentration in the North Pacific Ocean (1989-90)",
  "description": "Publication Title: Observation of carbon dioxide concentrations in air and surface sea water in the western North Pacific Ocean (pub.1991). In English; summary also in Japanese. Reprint. Originally published in: Oceanographical magazine, vol. 41, nos. 1-2, March 1991. Title from cover. Includes bibliographical references. Includes results of a study to determine the seasonal variability and long-term trend of carbon dioxide concentration in the western North Pacific Ocean. Available from the NOAA Library System: URL http://www.lib.noaa.gov/.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: This publication is in the National Climatic Data Center's Foreign Data Library, and is one of many books, atlases, maps, charts and other printed materials received by the NCDC from many nations over the years.",
